---
import Section from './Section.astro';
---

<Section id="about">
  <div class="card about" data-reveal>
    <div class="text">
      <p>
        I'm a DevOps engineer at AIIT Solutions in Islamabad (hybrid), where I run the AWS infrastructure,
        CI/CD and monitoring for HR360HUB, a multi-service Laravel SaaS.
      </p>
      <p>
        Before that I was a remote DevOps intern at Al Nafi International College, working with AWS,
        Terraform, Kubernetes on EKS, Prometheus and Grafana, and then at Cloudlem on CI/CD reliability.
      </p>
    </div>
    <p class="now">
      Currently applying for Master's programmes in Europe for 2027 and open to remote DevOps roles.
    </p>
  </div>
</Section>

<style>
  .about {
    display: grid;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    padding: clamp(1.25rem, 4vw, 2.5rem);
  }

  .text {
    display: grid;
    gap: 1rem;
    max-width: 42rem;
    font-size: var(--step-1);
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .now {
    align-self: start;
    padding: 1rem 1.125rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    background: var(--accent-soft);
    color: var(--ink);
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  @media (min-width: 64rem) {
    .about {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) 18rem;
      gap: 3rem;
    }
  }
</style>
